WEBVTT

00:00:28.417 --> 00:00:31.083
It's barely noticeable, but it sounds dull...

00:00:31.083 --> 00:00:33.792
I'm sure the tuning was done perfectly.

00:00:35.792 --> 00:00:38.167
Let me introduce you to
our new transfer student.

00:00:41.667 --> 00:00:44.083
My name is Akbarjin Badbayar.

00:00:44.083 --> 00:00:45.583
Nice to meet you.

00:00:45.583 --> 00:00:53.583
Akba... Akbarjin finished the Meson Asia
District's training course with excellent marks.

00:00:53.583 --> 00:00:57.833
He's an Element candidate who's
expected to be an immediate asset.

00:00:57.833 --> 00:01:00.292
Please be nice to him, everyone.

00:01:00.292 --> 00:01:04.250
A candidate from the start, huh?
I hope he's useful.

00:01:06.167 --> 00:01:11.875
Th-Those are... actual... Rare Iguras...

00:01:11.875 --> 00:01:14.875
I wonder if he's interested
in holes. I hope he is.

00:01:14.875 --> 00:01:17.458
Y-Yeah.

00:01:17.458 --> 00:01:19.625
He's quite cute.

00:01:19.625 --> 00:01:21.917
I bet he's a "bottom." Definitely a "bottom."

00:01:21.917 --> 00:01:26.542
Oh, but perhaps he's only pretending to
be one, but is actually a "top"? Oh, wow...

00:01:27.542 --> 00:01:31.583
I hope he doesn't get turned into
a weirdo by the guys in this class.

00:01:31.583 --> 00:01:33.542
Why are you staring at him so intently?

00:01:33.542 --> 00:01:35.625
--What?
--Is he your type?

00:01:35.625 --> 00:01:39.458
I-It's not like that. I was just
remembering the time I started here...

00:01:39.458 --> 00:01:42.750
...since I was a transfer student, too.

00:01:47.458 --> 00:01:48.958
<i>Reverence!</i>

00:01:48.958 --> 00:01:53.042
<i>Living your life don't give up now</i>
<i>keep moving on</i>

00:01:53.042 --> 00:01:58.667
<i>I'll hold you over and over and over again</i>

00:01:58.667 --> 00:02:04.500
<i>I'll probably meet you tomorrow</i>

00:02:04.500 --> 00:02:10.208
<i>Relying on the dim starlight</i>

00:02:10.208 --> 00:02:16.292
<i>I'll recognize you, I know I will</i>

00:02:16.292 --> 00:02:26.208
<i>After a hundred eons, the two of us</i>
<i>will open the door of legend</i>

00:02:26.208 --> 00:02:32.083
<i>Leaping over the blue abyss</i>

00:02:32.083 --> 00:02:37.917
<i>in order to live and die together with you</i>

00:02:37.917 --> 00:02:48.833
<i>I journeyed through many reincarnations</i>
<i>with sadness in my heart</i>

00:02:48.833 --> 00:02:51.875
<i>I'm at my full power and yet still incomplete</i>

00:02:51.875 --> 00:02:54.750
<i>Being by your side</i>

00:02:54.750 --> 00:03:00.542
<i>brings warmth to my cold heart and with it, pain</i>

00:03:00.542 --> 00:03:03.583
<i>But I'll always be by your side</i>

00:03:03.583 --> 00:03:06.458
<i>I'll always stay close to you</i>

00:03:06.458 --> 00:03:11.125
<i>The two of us will board the ship of light</i>

00:03:11.125 --> 00:03:16.958
<i>Let's play the wind's opening chords (Awaken!)</i>

00:03:18.583 --> 00:03:20.375
"One-Eyed Transfer Student"

00:03:20.375 --> 00:03:22.833
"One-Eyed Transfer Student"
Hey, was your training school coed?

00:03:22.833 --> 00:03:26.625
It wasn't. You'd know if you checked.

00:03:26.625 --> 00:03:29.000
What kind of music do you listen to?

00:03:34.042 --> 00:03:36.833
What's with him? He's obnoxious.

00:03:45.083 --> 00:03:47.625
What should I do in that kind of situation?

00:03:47.625 --> 00:03:51.083
Well, in any case, I need to observe.

00:03:51.083 --> 00:03:53.583
Hey, have you walked around the academy?

00:03:53.583 --> 00:03:55.083
Shall I show you around?

00:03:58.000 --> 00:03:59.792
Observe...

00:03:59.792 --> 00:04:01.292
Observe...!

00:04:02.417 --> 00:04:04.792
Observe!

00:04:04.792 --> 00:04:06.375
What's with him?!

00:04:12.458 --> 00:04:15.708
I'll show you around
the academy. Come with me.

00:04:18.292 --> 00:04:20.417
That's the Berlin Wall.

00:04:20.417 --> 00:04:22.125
That wall divided the academy at Neo-DEAVA

00:04:22.125 --> 00:04:25.917
into separate male and
female areas for a long time.

00:04:25.917 --> 00:04:28.458
But the wall was partially broken down and...

00:04:29.917 --> 00:04:32.792
I'm explaining the wall to you.
Take a good look at it.

00:04:33.958 --> 00:04:37.042
Can you really see it? That hair
of yours seems to be in the way.

00:04:37.042 --> 00:04:38.542
Don't touch me!

00:04:42.208 --> 00:04:45.333
I can see just fine.

00:04:52.708 --> 00:04:55.667
This is the hub of Neo-DEAVA.

00:04:55.667 --> 00:04:57.708
Here they keep tabs on
the Elements' conditions

00:04:57.708 --> 00:05:01.000
and manage Aquarion's strategies and tactics.

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:02.667
Aquarion?

00:05:12.167 --> 00:05:14.417
Observe as much as you like.

00:05:14.417 --> 00:05:19.083
If there's no falsehood in your heart,
things will appear correctly to you.

00:05:25.250 --> 00:05:27.667
What is this Aquarion that
you were talking about earlier?

00:05:27.667 --> 00:05:30.708
You came from a training school,
and yet you don't know?

00:05:30.708 --> 00:05:33.208
It's the new name for Aquaria.

00:05:33.208 --> 00:05:35.292
Is he talking about the Mechanical Angel?

00:05:35.292 --> 00:05:36.958
That's the one.

00:05:40.292 --> 00:05:43.542
If you're showing him around,
you should do it nicely.

00:05:43.542 --> 00:05:45.708
I'm doing it nicely enough.

00:05:45.708 --> 00:05:47.375
It's so nice, it's almost annoying.

00:05:47.375 --> 00:05:48.708
How dare you?!

00:05:48.708 --> 00:05:51.333
Hey! Don't be violent!

00:05:51.333 --> 00:05:53.875
Why would I become violent
over a little remark like that?!

00:05:53.875 --> 00:05:56.542
But you grabbed me by the collar.

00:05:56.542 --> 00:05:58.958
That was because you
laid your hands on Mikono.

00:05:58.958 --> 00:06:01.458
Laid my hands on... But back then, it was like...

00:06:01.458 --> 00:06:04.750
Back then? Then, are you
laying your hands on her <i>now</i>?

00:06:04.750 --> 00:06:08.292
N-No, I didn't mean it that way.

00:06:08.292 --> 00:06:09.792
Huh?

00:06:11.250 --> 00:06:12.750
Where'd he go?

00:06:17.167 --> 00:06:19.542
A hangar?

00:06:19.542 --> 00:06:22.292
Are these the machines that
comprise the Mechanical Angel?

00:06:27.417 --> 00:06:29.583
Snatching the Mechanical Angel?

00:06:29.583 --> 00:06:32.417
I'm not saying that you have
to bring the whole thing.

00:06:32.417 --> 00:06:35.000
Even one of its components would do.

00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:37.083
I feel like there are too many missions.

00:06:37.083 --> 00:06:39.583
It's fine if you can't do it.

00:06:39.583 --> 00:06:44.792
Our first objective is to search for a
Rare Igura who can be the "true Eve."

00:06:44.792 --> 00:06:48.667
We're all glad to find out that you're alive.

00:06:48.667 --> 00:06:53.333
Fulfill the orders quickly and
come back as soon as possible.

00:06:53.333 --> 00:06:56.292
Then I wish you'd send someone to get me...

00:06:56.292 --> 00:06:57.625
What'd you say?

00:06:57.625 --> 00:06:59.750
Nothing.

00:06:59.750 --> 00:07:03.042
At any rate, infiltrate Neo-DEAVA.

00:07:03.042 --> 00:07:05.333
We'll discuss the details after that.

00:07:05.333 --> 00:07:08.208
Okay. I'll do it.

00:07:11.208 --> 00:07:13.917
Even though this is Alicia's sacred birthplace,

00:07:13.917 --> 00:07:16.458
I don't intend to stay in
a place like this for long.

00:07:23.958 --> 00:07:29.042
Such primitive devices, programs,
and network environments...

00:07:30.333 --> 00:07:32.458
It's a piece of cake to falsify the background

00:07:32.458 --> 00:07:35.458
of the student who was going to
enter the academy at Neo-DEAVA.

00:07:36.667 --> 00:07:39.208
I'm going to quickly find...

00:07:39.208 --> 00:07:41.333
...the strongest Rare Igura.

00:07:54.792 --> 00:07:56.750
If anything, this is actually convenient.

00:07:56.750 --> 00:07:59.667
I can investigate without anyone bothering me.

00:07:59.667 --> 00:08:03.417
Like I said... why do you have
to dig in a place like that?!

00:08:03.417 --> 00:08:06.500
My gut instinct tells me to dig here.

00:08:06.500 --> 00:08:09.208
No one can stop me!

00:08:09.208 --> 00:08:10.750
Geez...

00:08:22.375 --> 00:08:23.500
I can't get my arms out!

00:08:23.500 --> 00:08:25.833
That's your punishment for not listening to me!

00:08:25.833 --> 00:08:26.875
M-My arms...!

00:08:26.875 --> 00:08:29.625
S-So that's a Rare Igura...!

00:08:31.042 --> 00:08:35.250
Don't you think that the students are
too casual with each other these days?

00:08:35.250 --> 00:08:38.042
Really? I haven't noticed anything.

00:08:38.042 --> 00:08:41.083
Geez... You shouldn't be so optimistic!

00:08:41.083 --> 00:08:45.625
To a certain extent, it's only natural
with the wall suddenly gone.

00:08:45.625 --> 00:08:47.542
You know better than anyone

00:08:47.542 --> 00:08:51.750
the terror that ensues when Elements'
feelings develop into romance!

00:08:51.750 --> 00:08:55.000
If we're so worried about that,
we can't even have them merge.

00:08:55.000 --> 00:08:57.083
That'd be like putting
the cart before the horse.

00:08:57.083 --> 00:08:58.208
But...!

00:08:58.208 --> 00:08:59.958
Worrying will get you more wrinkles.

00:08:59.958 --> 00:09:01.333
Wha...?

00:09:01.333 --> 00:09:03.250
Listen to me seriously! I...

00:09:03.250 --> 00:09:05.833
What?

00:09:05.833 --> 00:09:08.042
H-Hey! Oh, no!

00:09:08.042 --> 00:09:11.917
Seriously?! That's a Rare Igura?
This is too much.

00:09:11.917 --> 00:09:13.750
Now, hurry! Hurry!

00:09:14.750 --> 00:09:16.417
Two limited-edition
melon-flavored buns, please!

00:09:16.417 --> 00:09:19.750
--Me, too!
--What's your problem?! I had it first!

00:09:28.875 --> 00:09:30.625
Rare Iguras...?

00:09:30.625 --> 00:09:32.500
Women?

00:09:32.500 --> 00:09:35.542
They're totally different from Silffy.

00:09:35.542 --> 00:09:37.042
Who's there?!

00:09:40.625 --> 00:09:42.500
A peeping Tom! Kick him out!

00:09:42.500 --> 00:09:44.625
No way! That transfer student?

00:09:44.625 --> 00:09:45.792
Really?!

00:09:45.792 --> 00:09:47.417
Oh, no!

00:09:47.417 --> 00:09:49.708
Don't let him out! Lock the door!

00:09:51.833 --> 00:09:53.583
What shall we do with you?

00:09:53.583 --> 00:09:55.292
Shall we strip him naked?

00:09:55.292 --> 00:09:57.542
Let's crucify him! Crucify him!

00:09:57.542 --> 00:09:59.500
E-Excuse me...

00:10:00.792 --> 00:10:04.125
I don't think he did it on purpose.

00:10:04.125 --> 00:10:08.125
Right after I transferred here,
I often made mistakes, too.

00:10:09.292 --> 00:10:13.875
There was even a time I went into
the boys' restroom. I'm so embarrassed.

00:10:13.875 --> 00:10:15.917
Whose voice is that?

00:10:15.917 --> 00:10:18.500
--Is that right?
--What?

00:10:18.500 --> 00:10:21.625
You walked in here without knowing
this was the girls' locker room?

00:10:21.625 --> 00:10:26.125
Y-Yeah. I made a mistake! It's true. It's true!

00:10:32.458 --> 00:10:37.750
Hey, I've been waiting for you,
Akba... something-jin!

00:10:37.750 --> 00:10:40.625
Let's see... Ak... Ak...

00:10:40.625 --> 00:10:41.833
What was it again?

00:10:41.833 --> 00:10:44.625
Jin's fine. Jin! Right?

00:10:44.625 --> 00:10:47.208
I'm Andy! Welcome to our academy!

00:10:56.917 --> 00:10:58.458
H-Hey...!

00:11:02.042 --> 00:11:03.875
What's this Jin business?!

00:11:05.708 --> 00:11:08.500
Hey, are you interested in holes?

00:11:08.500 --> 00:11:09.500
Holes?

00:11:09.500 --> 00:11:11.000
Yep, holes!

00:11:16.417 --> 00:11:21.667
Give me a break. Does the word
"privacy" not exist in this world?

00:11:28.458 --> 00:11:31.917
And, there's, like, no way, right? It's too crazy.

00:11:31.917 --> 00:11:35.083
It's so totes crazy that even trying
to imagine it blows your mind!

00:11:35.083 --> 00:11:38.542
Yeah, and that story I heard
earlier is, like, on fire.

00:11:38.542 --> 00:11:42.167
Seriously, it's on fire! It's totes
unbelievable! Isn't it, like, crazy?

00:11:42.167 --> 00:11:46.500
Are they using some sort of code?
How can they make conversation like that?

00:11:46.500 --> 00:11:48.917
Rare Iguras are unbelievably deep...!

00:11:55.958 --> 00:11:58.083
Hey, is this seat open?

00:11:58.083 --> 00:11:59.083
Yes.

00:11:59.083 --> 00:12:02.125
Oh, Mikono. And Amata too...

00:12:02.125 --> 00:12:04.167
It seems like you're about to disappear again.

00:12:04.167 --> 00:12:07.708
I-I'm okay, somehow...

00:12:07.708 --> 00:12:09.000
Is something wrong?

00:12:09.000 --> 00:12:13.958
Um, well, I've been meaning
to say this to you two...

00:12:13.958 --> 00:12:16.625
I'm really sorry about the other day.

00:12:21.208 --> 00:12:23.625
Oh, that was a long time ago.

00:12:23.625 --> 00:12:27.792
Well, Mikono just decided to
take it the wrong way, so...

00:12:27.792 --> 00:12:30.125
Decided to?!

00:12:30.125 --> 00:12:32.292
Oh, just kidding. Sorry. Sorry.

00:12:32.292 --> 00:12:35.250
You're awful, Amata.

00:12:35.250 --> 00:12:37.792
--It's true that--
--You two... are close.

00:12:37.792 --> 00:12:39.000
What?!

00:12:39.000 --> 00:12:40.708
W-Well...

00:12:40.708 --> 00:12:42.125
I don't know what to say.

00:12:42.125 --> 00:12:44.458
Really, it's not like that at all.

00:12:44.458 --> 00:12:46.500
Oh, Jin!

00:12:48.042 --> 00:12:49.042
Jin...?

00:12:49.042 --> 00:12:54.458
Yeah, Andy nicknamed him Jin,
since it's hard to remember his name.

00:12:54.458 --> 00:12:57.333
I wonder if he's not good at socializing.

00:12:57.333 --> 00:12:59.000
That's why I'm worried about him.

00:12:59.000 --> 00:13:00.958
What?

00:13:00.958 --> 00:13:03.625
Ah... well, it's not like that.

00:13:03.625 --> 00:13:06.000
He kinda reminds me of my old self.

00:13:06.000 --> 00:13:07.708
What?

00:13:07.708 --> 00:13:12.708
It's not like... I was able
to disappear from the start.

00:13:12.708 --> 00:13:17.750
After I transferred here,
people talked to me at first,

00:13:17.750 --> 00:13:22.417
but I was so shy that I couldn't
communicate with them well.

00:13:24.542 --> 00:13:28.167
Soon, I was alone...

00:13:28.167 --> 00:13:31.167
...as if no one could see me anymore.

00:13:33.625 --> 00:13:38.000
So I started wishing that they
really wouldn't be able to see me.

00:13:38.000 --> 00:13:40.833
I thought I'd rather be that way.

00:13:40.833 --> 00:13:43.417
I felt that way for a very long time.

00:13:44.500 --> 00:13:46.167
Then...

00:13:51.917 --> 00:13:54.708
I didn't know...

00:13:54.708 --> 00:13:57.333
It was my own fault.

00:13:57.333 --> 00:14:02.583
Everyone was warm and welcomed me,
but I couldn't make that first step.

00:14:02.583 --> 00:14:05.917
So I'm concerned about Jin.

00:14:05.917 --> 00:14:08.875
This voice... Is she the one
from the locker room?

00:14:12.292 --> 00:14:14.625
What's the matter, my good friend?

00:14:18.292 --> 00:14:22.417
That's my line. It's rare to
see you in a place like this.

00:14:22.417 --> 00:14:25.792
You look rather pale.
Are you having nightmares again?

00:14:27.917 --> 00:14:30.917
That wedding in mourning clothes?

00:14:30.917 --> 00:14:33.042
A one-eyed giant.

00:14:35.875 --> 00:14:38.375
One-eyed giant?

00:14:38.375 --> 00:14:40.750
I wonder what that portends...

00:14:40.750 --> 00:14:43.542
Life would be easy if I knew the answer.

00:14:43.542 --> 00:14:47.083
More importantly, I take it you want
to talk to me about something.

00:14:47.083 --> 00:14:52.833
There's this noise that concerns me.
I thought I should let you know.

00:14:52.833 --> 00:14:54.042
Noise?

00:14:54.042 --> 00:14:59.208
A small noise that's been here in
the academy since a few days ago...

00:14:59.208 --> 00:15:01.083
I thought it might have something to do

00:15:01.083 --> 00:15:03.583
with the vanished Abductor
you've been concerned about.

00:15:03.583 --> 00:15:05.583
Since a few days ago...

00:15:15.333 --> 00:15:16.958
I don't understand!

00:15:20.042 --> 00:15:22.917
I guess checking these things
would be pointless, huh?

00:15:22.917 --> 00:15:25.125
Rare Iguras are mysterious.

00:15:31.833 --> 00:15:33.333
Ow!

00:15:36.292 --> 00:15:38.083
I-I'm sorry!

00:15:38.083 --> 00:15:40.958
--What?
--That's mine.

00:15:40.958 --> 00:15:42.875
Ah, Jin!

00:15:44.500 --> 00:15:46.708
What?!

00:15:46.708 --> 00:15:48.250
She disappeared?!

00:15:49.458 --> 00:15:50.958
Th-This...

00:15:50.958 --> 00:15:53.625
Thank you very much.

00:15:53.625 --> 00:15:56.208
Is that device of yours okay?

00:15:56.208 --> 00:15:58.000
Wh-What're you talking about?!

00:15:59.292 --> 00:16:03.500
I'm sorry, but I don't think
it's a bad hobby or anything.

00:16:03.500 --> 00:16:05.333
More importantly, you surprised me!

00:16:05.333 --> 00:16:08.583
You can disappear, huh?! That's amazing!

00:16:08.583 --> 00:16:10.000
Amazing?

00:16:10.000 --> 00:16:12.542
You can be alone when you want to, right?

00:16:12.542 --> 00:16:14.458
That's true, but...

00:16:14.458 --> 00:16:18.458
That's incredible! No one would bother you.

00:16:19.583 --> 00:16:22.583
I don't think being alone is good.

00:16:22.583 --> 00:16:23.833
Why not?

00:16:23.833 --> 00:16:26.417
Why not? It's lonely.

00:16:26.417 --> 00:16:27.917
But it's carefree.

00:16:27.917 --> 00:16:31.042
But it's not good. It's really not good.

00:16:31.042 --> 00:16:33.250
I was lucky enough to be
surrounded by people...

00:16:33.250 --> 00:16:36.375
I had many chances to make friends...

00:16:36.375 --> 00:16:40.250
And yet... And yet, I was...

00:16:46.708 --> 00:16:49.875
Ah! I feel... embarrassed!

00:17:01.958 --> 00:17:06.333
The noise that's been here in the
academy since a few days ago...

00:17:06.333 --> 00:17:08.042
One-eyed giant...

00:17:09.250 --> 00:17:14.167
If he was the pilot of that "giant"...
Of that Abductor...

00:17:19.542 --> 00:17:23.708
Mix. Element power, Spatial Augmentation?

00:17:23.708 --> 00:17:25.958
Does this mean filling holes?

00:17:25.958 --> 00:17:28.250
Base Element Index, 112.

00:17:28.250 --> 00:17:30.750
Aura level's rate of increase, pattern A.

00:17:30.750 --> 00:17:35.375
Hey, Jin! If you're not doing anything,
wanna go dig some holes?

00:17:35.375 --> 00:17:37.000
Oh? It doesn't open.

00:17:37.000 --> 00:17:39.833
People normally lock their doors, don't they...?

00:17:39.833 --> 00:17:43.000
Who'd go digging holes?!

00:17:43.000 --> 00:17:44.417
Yunoha...

00:17:44.417 --> 00:17:49.208
Yunoha Suroor. Element power,
Optical Fluoroscopy.

00:17:49.208 --> 00:17:50.708
What?

00:18:02.125 --> 00:18:06.292
I read your report. You did a good job.

00:18:06.292 --> 00:18:07.625
Thank you.

00:18:07.625 --> 00:18:11.458
As far as we can tell from the data,
they are as we thought.

00:18:11.458 --> 00:18:13.583
It seems that the Rare Iguras in the base

00:18:13.583 --> 00:18:19.125
are highly likely to have the
quality to become the "true Eve."

00:18:19.125 --> 00:18:22.625
The Rare Iguras are all scary.

00:18:22.625 --> 00:18:26.250
They look like they couldn't hurt a fly,
but they twist guys around their fingers.

00:18:26.250 --> 00:18:29.292
Also, they have a dangerous weapon, too.

00:18:29.292 --> 00:18:32.375
A weapon? What is it?

00:18:32.375 --> 00:18:33.417
Tears...

00:18:33.417 --> 00:18:36.333
Tears? Did something happen?

00:18:36.333 --> 00:18:38.833
What? Something? Well...

00:18:38.833 --> 00:18:41.667
...I got crushed once, and then again...

00:18:41.667 --> 00:18:43.167
You got defeated again?

00:18:43.167 --> 00:18:45.167
It's not like that, but...

00:18:45.167 --> 00:18:49.667
If there's a Rare Igura you hate,
then you can bring her with you.

00:18:49.667 --> 00:18:51.000
What?

00:18:51.000 --> 00:18:57.167
Our ultimate goal is to secure a
Rare Igura who can be the "true Eve."

00:19:01.250 --> 00:19:03.375
You wanna dig holes?

00:19:03.375 --> 00:19:06.125
Whoa! So you finally feel up to it?!

00:19:06.125 --> 00:19:09.125
I don't think you should. It's quite tough.

00:19:09.125 --> 00:19:12.833
Don't be jealous, Amata, just because
you want to dig with me alone.

00:19:12.833 --> 00:19:14.667
J-Jealous?!

00:19:14.667 --> 00:19:16.250
All right!

00:19:16.250 --> 00:19:18.375
From now on, we're the
three hole-digging brothers!

00:19:18.375 --> 00:19:20.792
Hey! Wh-Why are you taking me too?!

00:19:30.625 --> 00:19:33.833
All right! You did well.

00:19:33.833 --> 00:19:37.667
Look at this, Jin. This is the
world we cut our way into!

00:19:37.667 --> 00:19:39.875
The forbidden girls' dorm!

00:19:39.875 --> 00:19:44.125
Hey, Amata! Hurry up already! Geez...

00:19:46.125 --> 00:19:50.042
You're slow. Jin's a lot... Huh?

00:19:51.167 --> 00:19:52.708
Where'd he go?

00:19:54.167 --> 00:19:56.208
Jin! Where are you?!

00:19:56.208 --> 00:19:58.042
Shhh!

00:19:58.042 --> 00:20:02.250
Don't yell so loudly. They'll find the hole.

00:20:02.250 --> 00:20:04.042
You're only worried about the hole?

00:20:09.917 --> 00:20:12.458
So that's Yunoha's room...

00:20:15.417 --> 00:20:18.500
The Rare Igura who crushed me...

00:20:32.083 --> 00:20:33.125
Jin?!

00:20:33.125 --> 00:20:38.083
Um, well... I wanted to hear more
about what you were saying today...

00:20:38.083 --> 00:20:41.000
More of the story about
how being alone isn't good!

00:20:46.042 --> 00:20:49.583
O-Oh, no... Wh-What should I do?

00:20:49.583 --> 00:20:52.708
But Jin said he wanted to hear
more about what I was saying.

00:20:52.708 --> 00:20:55.458
Does that mean he now wants to
become friends with everyone?

00:20:56.917 --> 00:20:59.167
So it's no good after all...

00:20:59.167 --> 00:21:00.667
No!

00:21:20.042 --> 00:21:23.583
--What was that noise?
--That was the sound of a stun ray gun!

00:21:23.583 --> 00:21:25.708
What're you trying to do to Yunoha?!

00:21:26.708 --> 00:21:28.667
"Do to her"? Nothing.

00:21:28.667 --> 00:21:30.625
I just came to talk to her, that's all.

00:21:30.625 --> 00:21:35.042
That's a lie! What's your real
purpose in coming to Neo-DEAVA?!

00:21:35.042 --> 00:21:36.667
Stop it, Cayenne!

00:21:38.583 --> 00:21:40.792
Let go of me! I'm not going
to kill him or anything!

00:21:40.792 --> 00:21:43.250
Of course not!

00:21:43.250 --> 00:21:45.042
I'm not gonna let you get away!

00:21:45.042 --> 00:21:47.458
Don't! Jin didn't do anything.

00:21:51.500 --> 00:21:53.000
Yunoha!

00:21:59.833 --> 00:22:02.125
Wall?! The wall protected them?

00:22:02.125 --> 00:22:05.542
So... this is his Element power?

00:22:06.833 --> 00:22:11.000
I-Is what just happened... my power?

00:22:26.042 --> 00:22:29.208
The noise still hasn't disappeared yet.

00:22:29.208 --> 00:22:32.750
But somehow, it's becoming clearer.

00:22:35.750 --> 00:22:38.708
The "power to cut off," huh?

00:22:38.708 --> 00:22:44.042
But the feeling you had once
can't be cut off so easily.

00:22:45.708 --> 00:22:47.875
Now, what're you going to do, young man?

00:22:49.250 --> 00:22:54.917
<i>Due to the kindness that doesn't know conflict</i>

00:22:54.917 --> 00:22:57.750
<i>The two get lost in the foggy forest</i>

00:22:57.750 --> 00:23:05.417
<i>and end up a thousand years apart</i>

00:23:05.417 --> 00:23:07.667
<i>An ashen harmony...</i>

00:23:07.667 --> 00:23:12.875
<i>Why can't love and freedom find each other?</i>

00:23:12.875 --> 00:23:18.458
<i>until they become dewdrops</i>
<i>in the wilderness one day</i>

00:23:18.458 --> 00:23:23.125
<i>The weight of the soul... The weight of love...</i>

00:23:23.125 --> 00:23:25.958
<i>I was listening to them with my entire body</i>

00:23:25.958 --> 00:23:32.625
<i>You look sorrowful and noble from behind</i>

00:23:32.625 --> 00:23:40.292
<i>If I could protect your dream all the way...</i>

00:23:40.292 --> 00:23:46.833
<i>A long flare that struggles against the moon</i>

00:23:46.833 --> 00:23:53.292
<i>A story that ends even before it begins</i>

00:23:53.292 --> 00:23:59.292
<i>The tears I softly put in the sky</i>
<i>are an unfinished sinfonia</i>

00:23:59.292 --> 00:24:00.542
<i>Just for you...</i>

00:24:00.542 --> 00:24:02.375
<i>Just for you...</i>

00:24:02.375 --> 00:24:08.917
<i>The will of the stars...</i>

00:24:08.917 --> 00:24:15.125
<i>I want to see you</i>

00:24:19.667 --> 00:24:21.000
I wonder why...

00:24:21.000 --> 00:24:23.917
When I think about her, my heart beats faster.

00:24:23.917 --> 00:24:26.833
It's just like when the new
downloadable vocalist clothes for Alicia

00:24:26.833 --> 00:24:29.708
was a pair of rare white bloomers.

00:24:30.458 --> 00:24:31.833
"Next Episode 'Calling of the Wild'"
Next on <i>Aquarion Evol</i>!

00:24:31.833 --> 00:24:33.333
"Next Episode 'Calling of the Wild'"
"Calling of the Wild."
